WEBVTT

00:06:27.621 --> 00:06:31.121
If that statistic translates
to the workforce at large,

00:06:31.121 --> 00:06:34.496
even just a little bit,
we could see some huge

00:06:34.496 --> 00:06:38.496
and interesting shifts in how people work
and do business in years to come.

00:06:39.371 --> 00:06:43.913
Your top issues were climate change,
wealth disparity and racial injustice.

00:06:44.538 --> 00:06:47.496
And I mean, Zig-Zag listeners, you're
obviously motivated people.

00:06:47.496 --> 00:06:48.954
You're listening to the show. Right.

00:06:48.954 --> 00:06:52.246
And beta testers, you especially you
volunteered to be my guinea pigs.

00:06:52.746 --> 00:06:57.871
But I heard lots of folks say they are
balancing this strange sense of optimism

00:06:57.871 --> 00:07:02.538
right now with feeling freaked
out and exhausted.